---
// Process Section — Service workflow timeline
---

<section class="section process" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">合作流程</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">从咨询到落地，每一步都清晰</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        不搞神秘，不玩套路。你随时知道我们在做什么、下一步是什么。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-timeline">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="process-step reveal">
        <div class="process-number">01</div>
        <div class="process-connector"></div>
        <div class="process-card card">
          <div class="icon-box process-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-title">需求沟通</h3>
          <p class="process-desc">
            30 分钟线上沟通，了解你的业务场景、痛点和目标。不卖课、不画饼，只聊你能用得上的东西。
          </p>
          <div class="process-meta">
            <span class="process-time">约 30 分钟</span>
            <span class="process-cost">免费</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="process-number">02</div>
        <div class="process-connector"></div>
        <div class="process-card card">
          <div class="icon-box process-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
              <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-title">方案定制</h3>
          <p class="process-desc">
            根据沟通结果出具定制方案，明确适用场景、交付物、时间节点和报价。方案不满意可以调整，确认后再推进。
          </p>
          <div class="process-meta">
            <span class="process-time">1-3 个工作日</span>
            <span class="process-cost">收定金</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="process-number">03</div>
        <div class="process-connector"></div>
        <div class="process-card card">
          <div class="icon-box process-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-title">开发交付</h3>
          <p class="process-desc">
            按方案执行，过程中保持沟通。关键节点会同步进展，有问题随时调整。交付成品 + 使用手册 + 培训。
          </p>
          <div class="process-meta">
            <span class="process-time">1-4 周</span>
            <span class="process-cost">按方案报价</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="process-number">04</div>
        <div class="process-connector"></div>
        <div class="process-card card">
          <div class="icon-box process-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="process-title">售后支持</h3>
          <p class="process-desc">
            交付后 30 天内免费答疑和小调整。后续如需迭代或新功能，按次或按月合作。你用得好，才是我的目标。
          </p>
          <div class="process-meta">
            <span class="process-time">30 天免费</span>
            <span class="process-cost">后续可续</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process-timeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .process-number {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .process-connector {
    width: 2px;
    height: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent), transparent);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .process-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .process-icon {
    /* Base styles from .icon-box in global.css */
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }

  .process-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .process-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .process-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .process-time,
  .process-cost {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .process-cost {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Horizontal connector line between steps (desktop) */
  .process-timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 38px;
    left: 12.5%;
    right: 12.5%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-light) 10%, var(--border-light) 90%, transparent);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .process-timeline {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .process-timeline::before {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .process-timeline {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .process-step {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .process-number {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      min-width: 40px;
    }

    .process-connector {
      display: none;
    }

    .process-card {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .process-icon {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }

    .process-meta {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
